        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="menu-footer">

        <h3>ARCADIA COFFEE CO.</h3>

        <p>GOOD COFFEE. GOOD MOMENTS.</p>

        <p>THANK YOU FOR VISITING!</p>

    </div>

</div>
</section>

</body>
</html>
